dates calendar_function v1
description "A date with the alias is_open that uses a calendar and takes an integer input. The code of every target has is_open for the calendar, so TypeScript, Python, Go, Rust and Wasm have the name twice (W001). PostgreSQL holds the two functions apart, by the types they take"
use calendar "../fixtures/calendars/weekends.cal"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  n        : int   range >=0 <=3

date is_open = received
  + n business days
